# sierra-hd: dump pictures, views and fonts as ScummVM's SCI engine draws them.
#
# With SIERRA_HD_DUMP_GRAPHICS=<directory> set, the engine draws every picture
# in several variants into cleared maps and writes the visual, priority and
# control maps, writes every view cel bitmap and every font glyph
# (engines/sci/sierra_hd_dump_graphics.cpp), then exits. Used by
# tools/graphics-compare to check sci-pic, sci-view and the fonts in sci-text
# (milestone 2).
